      "instruction": "For accent Buttons, use the shared bright light neon lime face and its owned colored inset illumination in both themes. Keep the entire face light, all glow inside the control, paint below the label, the control stationary and keyboard focus separate. Do not add dark upper shading, narrow hard light rims, noise, patterns, outside or drop shadows, lift, scale or whole-button filters. Primary and default Buttons are the flat ink fill; other component fills and neutral selection retain their own roles.",
