    {
      "id": "plain-task-copy",
      "title": "Name the action and consequence",
      "instruction": "In authored labels and operational feedback, name the action, object and result in sentence case with straight quotes, so people can predict the change. Keep the operation's name through the action, its confirmation and its result. Cut em dashes, promotional adjectives, three-beat slogans, setup-then-correct phrasing, decorative emoji and celebratory filler because they replace task information.",
