      "instruction": "For component chrome and app examples, use Archivo and Geist Mono according to the declared type roles. Use mono for literal machine text or an owned metadata role; whole explanatory paragraphs in mono flatten the reading hierarchy. Distinguish headings with the supported scale rather than arbitrary sizes, weight patches, gradient text or italic accent words.",
