    {
      "id": "purposeful-motion",
      "title": "Motion must have a named purpose",
      "category": "Visual",
      "instruction": "When pointer hover identifies a row or card, keep its target stationary. Animate explicit properties only to show a named state change or origin. Moving targets impede pointer use; avoid hover lift, scale, added shadows, transition: all and delayed row entrances in a dense workbench.",
