    {
      "id": "motion-tokens",
      "title": "Time motion with tokens",
      "instruction": "Take every transition and animation duration and easing from the motion tokens. Pick the duration by the size of what moves and the easing by whether it moves or only fades. A literal 150ms or ease-out drifts from its neighbours and cannot be tuned in one place.",
