    {
      "id": "no-copy-echo",
      "title": "Supporting text must add information",
      "category": "Copy",
      "instruction": "For notifications and helper text, add the consequence or next step instead of repeating the title. When completion is already visible in the active task, prefer one accessible in-place confirmation. Repeating the same result through a toast, banner and inline live region interrupts the next task.",
