    {
      "id": "pending-action",
      "title": "Pending preserves context",
      "category": "Interaction",
      "instruction": "When asynchronous work begins, show a named pending state where its result will appear. Keep the idle action label and outer box, expose busy state and block repeated activation while focus stays put. Reserve the known content shape, and keep useful rows and drafts visible so the person can see what is still outstanding.",
