      "title": "Announce completion only after completion",
      "category": "Interaction",
      "instruction": "Wait for the actual request or clipboard promise to fulfill before claiming success. A click, dialog dismissal or entered code is not a confirmed result. On rejection, keep the draft and offer a real recovery.",
